0082 lists-follow-the-layout-direction: A list's items are laid out, prepainted and painted in the list's own text style, as a div's children are, so a direction it says reaches them; a uniform list's rows scrolled sideways right to left move by the offset, where they moved by twice it (taffy already sets a root laid out right to left at the right of the width it is given, which grows by the offset)

